## Analiz
- `content-generators.ts:81` — findGenerator: sectionTitle normalizasyonu
- `content-generators.ts:92` — findGenerator: pattern normalizasyonu
- `section-updater.ts:56` — findSectionByTitle: title normalizasyonu
- `section-updater.ts:58` — findSectionByTitle: sectionTitle normalizasyonu
